            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Chay Diệu Hạnh",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary21025 contributions\n1\nVegetarian 🌱 hot 🥵 pot\nJun 2022 • Business\nFavourite 🤩 place, coming back after pandemic 😷 time in Saigon. This time vegetarian hot 🥵 pot as main dish with many starters. Really delicious 🤤 fried sticky rice 🍚 cake, spring rolls, tofu salat and drink 🍹. Great taste, good service and happy coming again\nWritten June 10, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
